s is an affiliate link. I earn if someone books through it.</span></label>\n<label class=\"tll-pen-checkbox\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"shout-4-comped\" value=\"yes\"><span>I got this free or discounted.</span></label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tll-shout-row\" data-tll-shout-row=\"5\" hidden>\n<p class=\"tll-shout-n\">Shout-out 5</p>\n<label class=\"tll-pen-field\"><span class=\"tll-pen-label\">Name</span><input class=\"tll-pen-input\" type=\"text\" name=\"shout-5-name\" maxlength=\"120\" placeholder=\"The place, the guide, the company\"></label>\n<div class=\"tll-shout-2\">\n<label class=\"tll-pen-field\"><span class=\"tll-pen-label\">Type</span><select class=\"tll-pen-input\" name=\"shout-5-type\"><option value=\"\">Pick one</option><option>Restaurant</option><option>Bar or cafe</option><option>Hotel or stay</option><option>Tour or guide</option><option>Transport</option><option>Shop</option><option>Other</option></select></label>\n<label class=\"tll-pen-field\"><span class=\"tll-pen-label\">City</span><input class=\"tll-pen-input\" type=\"text\" name=\"shout-5-city\" maxlength=\"80\"></label>\n</div>\n<label class=\"tll-pen-field\"><span class=\"tll-pen-label\">Link</span><input class=\"tll-pen-input\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"url\" name=\"shout-5-link\" maxlength=\"400\" placeholder=\"https://\"></label>\n<label class=\"tll-pen-checkbox\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"shout-5-affiliate\" value=\"yes\"><span>This is an affiliate link. I earn if someone books through it.</span></label>\n<label class=\"tll-pen-checkbox\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"shout-5-comped\" value=\"yes\"><span>I got this free or discounted.</span></label>\n</div>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"tll-shout-add\" data-tll-shout-add>+ Add another</button>\n<p class=\"tll-pen-helptext tll-shout-why\">Readers see a label next to each one: \"Affiliate link\" if you earn from it, \"Comped\" if you did not pay full price. Those links open with rel=\"sponsored\". Why: the FTC Endorsement Guides (16 CFR Part 255) ask for a clear disclosure of any paid or free relationship.</p>\n</div>\n</fieldset>\n"
